</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">与喜茶、奈雪的茶相比，更具价格优势，拥有较高的品质和颜值，能向上触及高端茶饮<br>消费群</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">与CoCo都可、书亦烧仙草等同价位品牌相比，产品颜值与文化属性更胜一筹</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p class=\"section-title\">3.坚持不涨价原则</p>\n        <p class=\"section-text\">结合长沙地区物价水平，在高流量地区提供优质产品与服务</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p class=\"section-title\">4.促销方式</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">开展“小主节”活动，开通会员卡享受充100送50、充200送100</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">雨天第二杯半价、周三特定产品半价、单品免费续杯、集卡点免费赠杯</p>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"illustrations\" aria-label=\"产品插图\">\n      <figure class=\"product\">\n        <figcaption class=\"product-name\">幽兰拿铁</figcaption>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"幽兰拿铁产品插图\">\n          [产品插图：幽兰拿铁]\n          <span class=\"spoon\"></span>\n          <span class=\"plant\"></span>\n          <span class=\"cup\"></span>\n          <span class=\"cream\"></span>\n          <span class=\"beans\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </figure>\n\n      <figure class=\"product middle\">\n        <figcaption class=\"product-name\">声声乌龙</figcaption>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"声声乌龙产品插图\">\n          [产品插图：声声乌龙]\n          <span class=\"spoon\"></span>\n          <span class=\"plant\"></span>\n          <span class=\"cup\"></span>\n          <span class=\"cream\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </figure>\n\n      <figure class=\"product right\">\n        <figcaption class=\"product-name\">筝筝纸鸢</figcaption>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"筝筝纸鸢产品插图\">\n          [产品插图：筝筝纸鸢]\n          <span class=\"plant\"></span>\n          <span class=\"cup\"></span>\n          <span class=\"cream\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
